### Method security: @PreAuthorize (GET, DELETE), @RolesAllowed (POST), @Secured (PUT)

###1. USER: GET all (@PreAuthorize) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

###

###2. USER: GET one (@PreAuthorize) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/1
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

###

###3. USER: UPDATE (@Secured) -> 403 Forbidden
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Chelsea",
  "transferFee": 80000000
}

###

###4. USER: CREATE (@RolesAllowed) -> 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic user user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Galatasaray",
  "transferFee": 75000000
}

###

###5. MANAGER: CREATE (@RolesAllowed) -> 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic manager manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Galatasaray",
  "transferFee": 75000000
}

###

###6. MANAGER: UPDATE (@Secured) -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic manager manager
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "4",
  "playerName": "Victor Osimhen",
  "fromClub": "Napoli",
  "toClub": "Chelsea",
  "transferFee": 80000000
}

###

###7. MANAGER: DELETE (@PreAuthorize ADMIN) -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Basic manager manager

###

###8. ADMIN: GET one (@PreAuthorize) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

###

###9. ADMIN: DELETE (@PreAuthorize ADMIN) -> 200
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers/4
Authorization: Basic admin admin

###

###10. WRONG PASSWORD: GET all -> 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Basic admin wrong
Accept: application/json

###
